    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrobator is a new NES emulator that brings some fresh features to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeline</strong>\u00a0- Your personal time machine: go back seconds, minutes, or hours, then replay or restart from any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AutoMap</strong>\u00a0- The world draws itself as you explore, viewable at any time with zoom and pan controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprite Replay</strong> -\u00a0Little ghost-sprites reenact your past triumphs (and face-plants) on top of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Backdrops</strong> - Personalize games with your own background images via color keying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion Interpolation </strong>- Enhances smoothness by inserting extra frames between existing ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Assistant</strong> - Plug in an AI sidekick for voice commands, banter, and other sorcery. *<i>OpenAI API credit required.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure-sensitive fast-forward, rewind, and slow-mo via gamepad triggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-resolution, unmixed audio waveforms with octave control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input lag reduction, CRT-style filter, sprite trail effect, built-in cheats, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the  site for more information.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrobator is a new NES emulator that brings some fresh features to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeline</strong>\u00a0- Your personal time machine: go back seconds, minutes, or hours, then replay or restart from any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AutoMap</strong>\u00a0- The world draws itself as you explore, viewable at any time with zoom and pan controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprite Replay</strong> -\u00a0Little ghost-sprites reenact your past triumphs (and face-plants) on top of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Backdrops</strong> - Personalize games with your own background images via color keying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion Interpolation </strong>- Enhances smoothness by inserting extra frames between existing ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Assistant</strong> - Plug in an AI sidekick for voice commands, banter, and other sorcery. *<i>OpenAI API credit required.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure-sensitive fast-forward, rewind, and slow-mo via gamepad triggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-resolution, unmixed audio waveforms with octave control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input lag reduction, CRT-style filter, sprite trail effect, built-in cheats, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the  site for more information.</p>",
